  "review": [
    "Actual manufacturer-authored datasheet PDF fetched independently from documented distributor mirror; bytes/SHA match. Commands0x2416/240B/2400 select low/medium/high nonstretch single-shot. Default5/7/16ms waits cover specified measurement maxima; read-address NACK is followed by STOP/gap and bounded retry.",
    "Root pin model independently defines SCL/SDA edge tasks and Python CRC polynomial0x31/initFF plus rational engineering-unit oracle; imports only tooling, no owner model/helper. All six command/address combinations, busy0/1/2 polling, endianness, ACK firstfive/NACK sixth byte, request snapshot and CE0 progress/output stall/pop are checked.",
    "RTL request acceptance is CE/rst/abort qualified. Response ready/valid intentionally operates independently of CE. CRC failure retains raw data and separate two-bit CRC flags. Abort waits for PHY command completion before STOP; PHY faults retain distinct detail code.",
    "Independent exhaustive Python evaluation confirms optimized divide65535 against exact integer division for both scales over all65536 raw values. Negative temperature range and humidity0..100000 fit declared widths.",
    "All70 persisted simulation-profile outputs match distinct physical log paths; all additional report SHA values checked. Three complete synthesis reports independently recounted including shared PHY:1482/1537/1485 LUT-class,zero DSP/BRAM9."
  ],
  "pipeline_review": [
    "Five registered numerical stages MUL8/SUM/DIV_PRE/DIVIDE/OFFSET preserve exact round-half-up numerator decomposition: 8bit products175000*255 fit26bits and100000*255 fit25bits; merged products fit34bits and remainders19bits.18bit quotient and signed19bit temperature offset fit all declared extrema.",
    "All conversion stages check abort before modifying next-stage or published outputs; reset clears every new register unconditionally. No PHY command remains pending after RSTOP before CRC/conversion. CE0 arithmetic proceeds and out_valid rises only after OFFSET or terminal abort/error.",
    "Owner numeric test exercises actual registered pipeline for all65536 raw values after independent Python quotient/CRC generation, as well as helper identities;12 added tests cover abort/reset at CRC validation and each of five stages with CE0. Independent pin regressions re-executed unchanged Python oracle under new RTL."
  ],
